Lane County, OR

************************************************************************


Your record request #26-825 has been submitted successfully.

Greetings



Lane County is in receipt of your public records request. We will provide y=
ou with additional information as soon as practicable and without unreasona=
ble delay.



Oregon public records law and the Lane Manual require the County to provide=
 the public a right to inspect any record that is not otherwise protected, =
or to obtain copies of public documents not otherwise protected.&nbsp;The C=
ounty is not obligated to create documents that do not exist, to provide do=
cuments that it is not the custodian of record for, to change the format th=
e documents are saved in, to provide the documents in a more expensive form=
at or format that the County doesn=E2=80=99t have the ability to provide th=
e documents in, or to explain the documents.&nbsp;&nbsp;

&nbsp;

It is the County=E2=80=99s policy to collect full cost for any documents pr=
ovided, as allowed by statute and subject to public interest waiver provisi=
ons under Oregon law.&nbsp;This will include staff time researching whether=
 or not the County is in possession of the related documents, and any other=
 actual costs of making public records available, including costs for summa=
rizing, compiling or tailoring the public records to meet the request, and =
any necessary redaction and review of the public records by staff. The Coun=
ty will inform you of the estimated cost and will wait to receive confirmat=
ion from you (and/or payment) prior to incurring any costs associated with =
complying with this public records request.&nbsp;



Sincerely,



Lane County Public Records





As the requester, you can always see the status of your
                  request by signing into the Lane County, OR
                  portal.
                 =20




                  If you haven't already signed in, you may need to
                  activate or setup your account to get started.
                  Once your account is activated, you can communicate direc=
tly with the Lane County, OR through NextRequest.


